  well as self.dmc. Regression test: setting_the_region_reaches_the_mapper.
- Box SunsoftFme7? -- DONE in de06bc3, -2.2% geomean. FME7 ROMs live in
  $HOME/Games/NES (2722 ROMs; ~/dev/roms is the small set and has no 069).
  Use the big library when a board needs coverage.

